OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds pay tribute to Minnie
OL,4,AMerriman in Arbroath
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people have gathered in
OL,7,FArbroath to pay tribute to a
OL,8,Fnine-year-old girl who died after being
OL,9,Ffound seriously injured in the Angus
OL,10,Ftown earlier this month.
OL,12,FMinnie Merriman, from Wakefield, West
OL,13,FYorkshire, died in hospital in Dundee
OL,14,Ffollowing an incident at Elliot
OL,15,FIndustrial Estate on 3 August.
OL,17,FMinnie's father Christopher Rice is
OL,18,Faccused of murdering his daughter and
OL,19,Fis currently remanded in custody ahead
OL,20,Fof a trial.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
