OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds pay tribute to Minnie
OL,4,AMerriman in Arbroath
OL,5,
OL,6,FA private ambulance carrying Minnie's
OL,7,Fbody stopped in Arbroath's Victoria
OL,8,FPark to allow the local community to
OL,9,Fpay their respects before the youngster
OL,10,Fwas taken home to England.
